     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · India Today · 2026-10-18 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Delhi High Court Quashes Lookout Circulars Against Authum Officials</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Delhi High Court has quashed lookout circulars issued against Authum Investment and Infrastructure Limited officials Amit Dangi and Sanjay Dangi. Justice Madhu Jain ruled that continued travel restrictions were unwarranted, noting the petitioners were not named as accused in the underlying CBI cases involving Reliance Commercial Finance and Reliance Home Finance.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-18/delhi-high-court-quashes-lookout-circulars-against-authum-of.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The court ordered the Enforcement Directorate to notify the Bureau of Immigration to update its records. The petitioners must continue cooperating with ongoing investigations, respond to official summons, and provide detailed travel itineraries to the investigating officer before any foreign trips.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief effectively summarizes the legal ruling and the conditions imposed on the petitioners.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/delhi-high-court-quashes-lookout-circulars-authum-officials-rcfl-rhfl-probe-ptag-3020288-2026-10-18?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/delhi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Delhi</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
