       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · News18 India · 2026-10-18 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Eyewitnesses Mistook Tiger Shroff Shooting for Diwali Firecrackers</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>An eyewitness to the shooting involving actor Tiger Shroff reported that bystanders initially mistook the gunfire for Diwali firecrackers. The incident occurred near a noisy birthday celebration in Juhu, where several vloggers were present to record content.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-18/eyewitnesses-mistook-tiger-shroff-shooting-for-diwali-firecr.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>According to the witness, a thin, poorly dressed man approached and opened fire, leading to confusion among the crowd. The witness observed blood at the scene and noted that the actor’s vehicle stopped shortly after the shots were fired. These eyewitness accounts regarding the sequence of events and the actor's condition have not yet been independently verified by authorities.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately summarizes the eyewitness account and includes the necessary disclaimer regarding verification.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/india/thought-they-were-diwali-crackers-eyewitness-recounts-tiger-shroff-firing-incident-ws-l-10387910.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
