      <ul><li><a href="https://www.livemint.com/money/personal-finance/3000-pension-wont-block-parents-medical-reimbursement-for-haryana-govt-employees-high-court-rules-11792342071809.html" rel="noopener">Livemint Money</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
