      <a href="/feed.xml" title="RSS">RSS</a>
      <button id="tdp-theme" title="Toggle light/dark">Light</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="catrow"><span class="catgrp"><b>News</b><a href="/category/national">national</a><a href="/category/world">world</a><a href="/category/defence">defence</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Money</b><a href="/category/business">business</a><a href="/category/finance">finance</a><a href="/category/education">education</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Sports</b><a href="/category/sports">sports</a><a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Culture</b><a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a><a href="/category/positive">positive</a><a href="/category/funny">funny</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Life</b><a href="/category/science">science</a><a href="/category/environment">environment</a><a href="/category/space">space</a><a href="/category/health">health</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Tech</b><a href="/category/tech">tech</a><a href="/category/ai">ai</a></span></nav></div><div class="gtr"><span>Read in your language:</span><div id="google_translate_element"></div></div><div class="wrap"><main id="content"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">← Front page</a> · <a href="/archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a></p>
     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-10-18 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Kashmera Shah Begins Production on Second Directorial Project in Greece</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actor-turned-filmmaker Kashmera Shah has commenced shooting her second directorial project in Greece. The film, described by Shah as an independent production, is backed by Zee and will be released as a microdrama on Zee Bullet. Specific details regarding the plot, cast, and release date remain undisclosed.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-18/kashmera-shah-begins-production-on-second-directorial-projec.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Shah emphasized the significance of the location, stating that Greece serves as a character within the story. She described the project as a personal milestone and an exhilarating step in her career as an independent filmmaker, encouraging others to step outside their comfort zones to pursue their dreams.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is concise and accurately reflects the provided source material without embellishment.</p>
