  <nav class="catrow"><span class="catgrp"><b>News</b><a href="/category/national">national</a><a href="/category/world">world</a><a href="/category/defence">defence</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Money</b><a href="/category/business">business</a><a href="/category/finance">finance</a><a href="/category/education">education</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Sports</b><a href="/category/sports">sports</a><a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Culture</b><a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a><a href="/category/positive">positive</a><a href="/category/funny">funny</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Life</b><a href="/category/science">science</a><a href="/category/environment">environment</a><a href="/category/space">space</a><a href="/category/health">health</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Tech</b><a href="/category/tech">tech</a><a href="/category/ai">ai</a></span></nav></div><div class="gtr"><span>Read in your language:</span><div id="google_translate_element"></div></div><div class="wrap"><main id="content"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">← Front page</a> · <a href="/archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/category/national">national</a></p>
     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · News18 India · 2026-10-18 · editor 7/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge conf" title="Reported by News18 India, India Today">confirmed by 2 sources</span></div>
       <h1>Maharashtra Deputy CM Eknath Shinde Assures Tiger Shroff of Support Following Shooting</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Maharashtra Deputy Chief Minister Eknath Shinde has promised full support to actor Tiger Shroff and his father Jackie Shroff following a shooting incident in Mumbai’s Juhu. Shinde condemned the attack as a serious concern, vowing that any gang responsible will be caught and held accountable.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-18/maharashtra-deputy-cm-eknath-shinde-assures-tiger-shroff-of-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>While the actor was unharmed, his driver and an autorickshaw driver sustained injuries. Police are investigating a claim of responsibility linked to the Lawrence Bishnoi gang, though its authenticity remains unverified. Shinde emphasized that law and order will be maintained and that the government will provide protection to those in the industry who require it.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article includes details about the location (Juhu) and injuries not present in the provided source summary, though they are in the full text.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source · also covered by 1 more</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/india/tiger-shroff-firing-eknath-shinde-speaks-with-actor-warns-gangs-will-not-be-spared-ws-l-10387911.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/tiger-shroff-car-firing-eknath-shinde-vows-strict-action-against-gangs-3020360-2026-10-18?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>This brief was written from the original report. The same event was independently covered by the other outlets listed here.</p>
    </div>
       
