       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · News18 India · 2026-10-18 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Video Footage Emerges of Attack on Tiger Shroff in Juhu</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>New video footage has surfaced showing the alleged attack on actor Tiger Shroff’s vehicle in Mumbai’s Juhu, capturing the sound of multiple gunshots and ensuing chaos. The video features a voice shouting “Tiger Bhai” as the incident unfolds near Pushpa Park.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-18/video-footage-emerges-of-attack-on-tiger-shroff-in-juhu.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>While the actor remained uninjured, his driver and an autorickshaw driver were reportedly wounded. Mumbai Police are currently examining the footage and CCTV evidence to identify the attackers. Although a message claiming responsibility from the Lawrence Bishnoi gang has circulated, authorities have not yet confirmed the involvement of any specific criminal group or the motive behind the shooting.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately reports the contents of the footage and the context of the investigation.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
