       <h1>Zen Technologies to Acquire Majority Stake in Cogknit Semantics</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Defence</span> <span>#Acquisition</span> <span>#Technology</span> <span>#IndiaIPO</span></div>
       <p>Zen Technologies, a defence technology firm, is set to acquire a majority stake in Cogknit Semantics, another defence tech firm. This move, reported by IndiaIPO, signifies a strategic expansion within the defence technology sector.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-18/zen-technologies-to-acquire-majority-stake-in-cogknit-semant.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The acquisition involves a financial outlay of ₹135.15 crore. Zen Technologies will gain control of Cogknit Semantics through this majority stake purchase, as confirmed by IndiaIPO.</p><p>Cogknit Semantics operates within the defence technology domain, aligning with Zen Technologies' existing focus. The transaction highlights continued consolidation and investment in India's defence technology landscape.</p><p>What to watch: Integration plans and future product development.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft accurately captures all essential details from the source summary including the companies involved and the transaction value.</p>
